__Get parameters__
* pageName = Any page name (required but not used)

__Get examples:__
{{{
// Simple URL
/OpenForum/Actions/TestExample?pageName=dummy

// Using JSON.get
JSON.get('/OpenForum/Actions/TestExample', null, 'pageName=dummy')
  .onSuccess(function(result) {
    console.log('Result:', result);
  }).go();
}}}

